 var h=back('Trade','menu')+'<div class="thH">Advanced trade test</div><p class="thP">'+(TRH==='both'?'Pick a league and both teams, or turn the league off and add players yourself. Then tap Trade on the players being swapped.':'Pick your team, or turn the league off and add players yourself. Tap Trade on the players you would send, then search who you would get.')+'</p><div class="tseg thSeg"><button type="button" class="tsb'+(TRH==='both'?' on':'')+'" data-go="both">Both teams</button><button type="button" class="tsb'+(TRH==='mine'?' on':'')+'" data-go="mine">Just my team</button></div>';
